SUMMARY:Access Quest
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Access Quest this October! We invite students\, faculty\, staff and community members to explore the UBC Vancouver campus and share what you notice about spaces\, environments and features that either support access or make access more difficult. This is your quest – find and share accessibility barriers and gold stars across campus. Every barrier or gold star you share gives you a chance to win an exciting prize! \nThis event welcomes everyone\, including disabled and non-disabled folks\, people living with chronic illness or injuries and anyone who wants to help make UBC more accessible. Your responses will help us better understand accessibility across campus and inform future planning and developments.
URL:https://events.ubc.ca/event/access-quest/
LOCATION:Hybrid Online/Virtual and In-Person – See Description\, Vancouver\, British Columbia\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Audience - All
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://events.ubc.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Kaiser-building.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Applied Science":MAILTO:info@apsc.ubc.ca
END:VEVENT
