SUMMARY:UBC CPD: Family Practice Anesthesia Journal Club 2026
DESCRIPTION:Participants review articles and discuss clinical cases with specialists on topics relevant to rural anesthesia practice\, including obstetrics\, pain management and induction agents. Sessions also explore how research findings can be applied to clinical practice. \n\nZoom Kick-off Meeting: Monday\, October 19\, 7-8 PM PT\nSession 1: Monday\, October 19 to Sunday\, November 1\nSession 2: Monday\, November 2 to Sunday\, November 15\nSession 3: Monday\, November 16 to Sunday\, November 29
