SUMMARY:Employer-led Workshop: Moment Energy
DESCRIPTION:What Recruiters Look For: Strengthen Your Interview Game \nCome and meet Eren Flood\, Talent Acquisition Lead at Moment Energy\, who will be sharing insights from the other side of the table. \nIn this engaging event\, Eren will share insights from her experience hiring talent\, how they assess applicants\, prevent freezing\, and how to impress recruiters and put your best possible self forward. \nThe workshop will include the following: \n\nResumes tips and tricks to make yourself stand out\nDo and Don’ts for interviews\nMini Mock Interviews\nCo-op roles and entry level roles Moment Energy is currently looking to fill\nRelevant disciplines include: Mechanical\, Electrical\, Supply Chain\, Software and Firmware\n\nPlease bring a copy of your resume to the event!
URL:https://events.ubc.ca/event/employer-led-workshop-moment-energy/
LOCATION:Brock Hall\, 1874 East Mall\, Vancouver\, British Columbia\, V6T1Z1\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Audience – All Students,Audience – Graduate Students,Audience – Undergraduate Students,Subject – Personal And Professional Development – Students,Type – Information Session/Fair
