DESCRIPTION:Build confidence in navigating hormone therapy throughout perimenopause and menopause. Explore practical prescribing\, hormone selection\, dosing\, monitoring and contraindications. Unpack practical challenges like navigating provincial coverage\, bleeding management\, addressing contraceptive needs\, and transitioning patients from contraceptives to MHT.
